out/
# Never bake a developer's credentials into the image. The Dockerfile copies the
# whole data/ tree, so the overlay patterns must be excluded by SHAPE, not by
# listing the two names that happen to exist today: config.local.mosip.json is
# exactly as secret-bearing as config.local.json, and an allow-list silently
# ships the next one someone creates. Mirrors the .gitignore patterns, negation
# for the tracked placeholder-only template included.
data/config/config.local.json
data/config/config.local.*.json
data/config/config.local.json.*
!data/config/config.local.example.json
data/config/config.json
# Same shape one directory up, for a working tree predating the data/ move.
config.local.json
config.local.*.json
config.json
conformance-suite-private/
*esignet-config*.json
api/**/*.test
.env
.git
